# This repo's working tree root sits at D:\Entwicklung, which is also where
# many unrelated, separate projects happen to live on disk (AI Development,
# KI-Projekt, PunishersGer with its own .git, etc.). None of that has ever
# actually been committed here (see git log) - only ever accidentally staged
# from running git commands from the wrong directory. Deny-by-default,
# allow-list only the paths that actually belong to this repo, so those
# other projects can never be swept into a commit again.
/*
!/.github
!/git
!/README.md
!/.gitignore

# git/ itself holds several other unrelated projects alongside demo/ -
# only demo/ is actually this repo's content.
/git/*
!/git/demo
